stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT : [Operator] POST /api/campaigns
    DRAFT --> SCHEDULED : [Operator] Schedule rollout time
    SCHEDULED --> DRAFT : [Operator] Cancel schedule
    DRAFT --> RUNNING : [Operator] PATCH /start
    SCHEDULED --> RUNNING : [System Scheduler] scheduledAt reached
    RUNNING --> PAUSED : [Auto-Pause Worker] Wave FailureRate > Threshold (N >= 50)\nOR [Operator] PATCH /pause
    PAUSED --> RUNNING : [Operator] PATCH /resume after investigation
    RUNNING --> COMPLETED : [Wave Worker] Final Wave COMPLETED\n(all tasks terminal or past deadlineAt)
    RUNNING --> ABORTED : [Operator] PATCH /abort\n(unstarted PENDING -> FAILED: CAMPAIGN_ABORTED)
    PAUSED --> ABORTED : [Operator] PATCH /abort\n(unstarted PENDING -> FAILED: CAMPAIGN_ABORTED)
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    ABORTED --> [*]
